  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Fishing_Lake?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/81/Fishing_Boat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712195437\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"The fishing boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"The fishing boat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/81/Fishing_Boat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20150712195437\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The fishing boat</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>fishing lake</b> is a game feature which gives players a new area to play in, and gain <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points and <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> as well as collect new <a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animal goods</a>.\n</p><p>It can be unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 27 by repairing the fishing boat, located on the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Music Soundtrack On The Fishing Lake</b></span></h3>\n<pre>   <span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGame_Soundtrack_Fishing_Lake.ogg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/File:Game_Soundtrack_Fishing_Lake.ogg</a></span>\n</pre>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Going to the lake</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9a/Fishing_Boat_Broken.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712195445\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"The broken fishing boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"The broken fishing boat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9a/Fishing_Boat_Broken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150712195445\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The broken fishing boat</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Repairing the fishing boat costs 10,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 5 minutes  (or 10<span>diamond</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"diamond\"><img alt=\"diamond\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>), giving player 47 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when finished. After taking the fishing boat to go to the lake, players can immediately use the <a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench</a> to make lures.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Catching fish</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-7449\" title=\"Fishing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing</a></i>\n</p><p>In this area, players can catch <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a> using <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nets</a>, and catch <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-16889\" title=\"Lobster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobsters</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ducks</a> using <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">traps</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Fishing lake buildings</b></span></h3>\n<p>There are several buildings around the fishing lake (see the map below):\n</p>\n<ul><li>the <a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench</a> to make <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a>.</li>\n<li>the <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Net Maker</a> to make <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-net-16888\" title=\"Fishing Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing nets</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-trap-17084\" title=\"Lobster Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster traps</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/duck-trap-17075\" title=\"Duck Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">duck traps</a>.</li>\n<li>the <a href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tackle box</a> to store lures, nets, and traps.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/fishing-7449\" title=\"Fishing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing spots</a> to catch <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-16889\" title=\"Lobster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobsters</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ducks</a>.</li>\n<li>the fisherman's hut to open the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-book-17693\" title=\"Fishing Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing book</a>.</li>\n<li>the <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pool-8477\" title=\"Lobster Pool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Pool</a> to extract <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-tail-8470\" title=\"Lobster Tail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster tails</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-16889\" title=\"Lobster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobsters</a>.</li>\n<li>the <a href=\"/wiki/duck-salon-17003\" title=\"Duck Salon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duck Salon</a> to extract <a href=\"/wiki/duck-feather-17011\" title=\"Duck Feather\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">feathers</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ducks</a>.</li>\n<li>the fishing boat to go back to the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a>.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Fishing_Lake.png/revision/latest?cb=20151026231526\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Town Map\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Town Map\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"389\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Town Map</figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Fishing lake character</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bd/Angus.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028162936\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Angus\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Angus\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Angus</figcaption></figure>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/angus-7540\" title=\"Angus\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Angus</a></i>\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/angus-7540\" title=\"Angus\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Angus</a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-characters-29468\" title=\"Category:Characters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">non-playable character</a> who, like Mr. Wicker, explains how various mechanics work as they are unlocked. Angus never leaves the lake, so players can watch the tutorials again by tapping on him.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Expansion</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/07/Fishing_Spot_Locked.png/revision/latest?cb=20151025103906\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A fishing spot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A fishing spot\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A fishing spot</figcaption></figure>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-23339\" title=\"Expansion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Expansion</a></i>\n</p><p><br>\nPlayers can unlock new fishing spots using <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">expansion supplies</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Tutorial</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"> <a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHay_Day_-_The_Fishing_Area_Guide\" class=\"video video-thumbnail large\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> \t<img alt=\"Hay_Day_-_The_Fishing_Area_Guide\" height=\"280\" width=\"500\" class=\"lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t\t</span> </a> <figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Video by <a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=User%3AR3DKNIGHT%20aka%20Ranger\" title=\"User:R3DKNIGHT aka Ranger\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">R3DKNIGHT aka Ranger</a>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Catching new fish is a nice and easy way to get <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.</li>\n<li>Upgrading the <a href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tackle box</a> requires the same supplies as upgrading the <a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">silo</a> does.</li>\n<li>Opening all the spots in the fishing lake (there's fifteen total) can help out greatly with fishing derby tasks.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901025635\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 881/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1692/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 47/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 651508/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.642      1 -total\n 52.53%   18.724      3 Template:Infoicon\n 24.97%    8.900      1 Template:Navigation\n  7.00%    2.496      1 Template:Languages\n  5.03%    1.793      3 Template:Main\n  3.58%    1.275      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  3.27%    1.166      8 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:23340-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901025635 and revision id 110753. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
